{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HaPPy HellOweeN"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トリックオアトリート♪\n言ったらまいまいななみ若月が\nお菓子くれたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはリハでまいやんとさゆりんの\nハロウィン髪飾り付けてたくらいしか\nらしいことしてない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは今日仮装しましたか。\nお菓子もらいにいきましたか。\n私にお菓子届けてくれましたか。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いたずらなら得意"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......すみません\n...お菓子くださいうおあえ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき帰宅したらテーブルに..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から大変だったけど\n楽しかった！\nその後リハあった！\n今日はぐっすり寝ようと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤ちゃんず"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/9718544/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も頑張りまりかー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}